{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">100 Trials is a difficult game that tasks you with making it through various challenges to make it to the end of each level. Test your mind as each trial can require different strategies and skills to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709750/extras/Projectile_Showcase.gif?t=1748030936\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">2D Top-Down Movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">10 Worlds with 10 trials, each upping the challenge as you go further by introducing new mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Automatically save your progress after completing each trial, allowing you to start from any level you have unlocked.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beat time thresholds to unlock medals on each trial.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Electronic Music that will keep you focused on the challenge in front of you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlockable Character Skins</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficult Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Alternative Gamemodes that add an extra challenge</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709750/extras/Rotating_Showcase.gif?t=1748030936\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709750?t=1748030936","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3709750?t=1748030936","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709750/532d68815efe61f28408fd644fff6012a6de86ff/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748030936","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3709750/532d6